### Task 7: MonitorEngine (regex match, window, ring buffer, dedupe, debounce)

**Files:** `src/monitor-engine.ts`
**Tests:** `test/monitor-engine.test.ts`

- [ ] **Step 1: Ring buffer** - MON_RING_BUFFER_SIZE=50_000 lines circular buffer. Append on each OutputEvent; wrap at capacity (overwrite oldest).
- [ ] **Step 2: Regex match** - on match: build match window (before/after context lines). Dedupe: skip if match line index already within previous match window.
- [ ] **Step 3: Debounce timer** - debounce seconds (default 5s). On match, cancel previous debounce timer; start new timer. After wait completes: schedule delivery + reset. If MON_AFTER_WAIT_MS (5s) elapses without new input on stdout: trigger final flush delivery regardless of debounce.
- [ ] **Step 4: Delivery payload** - build DeliveryPayload with nonce-fenced raw output, directive, matched lines, window context, event count. Apply caps: MON_DELIVERY_BYTES_CAP (16 KiB), MON_DELIVERY_EVENTS_CAP (200 events).
- [ ] **Step 5: Tests** - ring buffer cycles at 50_000; match window includes before/after; dedupe rejects overlapping match; debounce timer resets on new match; final flush fires after 5s silence.
- [ ] **Step 6: Verify** - `bun test test/monitor-engine.test.ts`. Expected: all pass.

